#: ../../intro/install.rst:125
msgid ""
"The registration output is printed as the last lines. On a hub that "
"admits by AID, the last line is the ``anet-hub admit`` command that the "
"hub operator runs; registration then completes without further input. See"
" :doc:`tutorial` for the full sequence."
